<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Not in the archive</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f6f5f2;
    color: #23201c;
    font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd8d0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  a.button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background: #2f6f4f;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a.button.secondary { background: #6b665e; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Not in the archive</h1>
  <p>
    This page is not part of the footbag.org capture. Some links on the old site were
    already broken before it was captured, and those links are preserved exactly as they
    were.
  </p>
  <p>
    Start from the archive home page and browse from there.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="/">Archive home</a>
    <a class="button secondary" href="${site_url}">Back to footbag.org</a>
  </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
